# Siblings that must be installed WITH their scripts on the CI venue.
#
# The venue installs adjacent siblings with --ignore-scripts, because they are
# normally require()'d as source. xchain-vm ships isolated-vm, a NATIVE addon,
# and this repo EXECUTES it: test/unit/spvSeedContract.test.js runs the real VM
# in-process, so without the compiled binding its `before all` hook dies with
# "Cannot find module ./out/isolated_vm" before a test runs.
#
# This file was missing while xchain-indexer and xchain-contracts both had one,
# and the omission is not stable-state: the cache key carries the install MODE,
# so the scripts-skipped tree survives until something invalidates it. A
# lockfile change did exactly that on 2026-08-17, the cache was refilled without
# the binding, and a green suite went red on a machine fault. A venue repaired
# by hand does not survive the next cache refill; declaring the mode here does.
#
# Kept out of .ci-siblings deliberately: that file is read verbatim as a list
# of repo NAMES by the shared ci-reusable.yml clone loop, by per-repo workflow
# loops and by roster guards, so a modifier written in-line there reaches
# GitHub as a repository that does not exist.
xchain-vm
